What this licence covers
------------------------

The work INITIATE.MY created:

  * the compilation and cleaning of the dataset, including
    Finalise-Codebook/final-data.csv
  * the research taxonomies (clusters and subclusters) and the classification
    of records against them
  * the codebook documents under Finalise-Codebook/ and Analysis-Reference/
  * the source of the website: index.html, styles.css, js/, and the data
    generation script Analysis-Reference/generate_data.py


What this licence does NOT cover
--------------------------------

The underlying Senarai Perintah Larangan prohibition records published by the
Ministry of Home Affairs (KDN), which INITIATE.MY compiled but did not create.

Government works are not automatically in the public domain in Malaysia, and
this project is not in a position to determine or grant rights over the
ministry's records on its behalf. The licence above applies to INITIATE.MY's
compilation, cleaning and classification of those records — not to the records
as originally published.

If you intend to republish the raw gazette records rather than INITIATE.MY's
work on them, seek your own advice or contact programme@initiate.my.

Third-party material reproduced in the site (publication cover images under
asset/img/covers/) is included for identification and commentary and remains
the property of its respective rights holders. It is not covered by this
licence.
